A brand exploration board for "omxplorer" (always lowercase), a desktop data app: a spreadsheet and reports over millions of rows, running on a GPU. Layout: a title row "omxplorer · logo concepts", then a 4 x 2 grid of eight equal white cards. Each card shows one app-icon mark in a large rounded-square tile, a small 32px version of the same tile beside it, and below them the wordmark "omxplorer" set in a geometric sans with the mark in place of the letter o, plus a one-line caption. Concepts: 1 a magnifying-glass o whose lens holds three rising bar-chart bars; 2 a magnifying-glass o whose lens shows a 3x3 spreadsheet grid with one highlighted cell; 3 a lens containing a sparkline; 4 a lens drawn as a GPU chip with pins around the ring; 5 a lens over rows of data with a selection ring; 6 a lowercase o built from stacked horizontal column stripes; 7 an "omx" monogram where the x's crossing is a lens; 8 a compass-like explorer's lens with a data dot. Flat, geometric, simple shapes legible at 16 px, no gradients, no mascots.
